~ start
Developer: Do you want to read the tutorial?
- Yes 
	Developer: Well then, I'll tell you now. 
	Developer: You can move up by pressing the "W" key.
	Developer: You can move to the right by pressing the "D" key.
	Developer: You can move left by pressing the "A" key.
	Developer: You can move down by pressing the "S" key.
	Developer: Вы можете стрелять при нажатии левой и правой клавиш мыши.
- No 
	Developer: Ну, на нет и суда нет. Удачи! 
=> END
do Gg.vis_ui()
do Gg.vis_man()
=> END
~ podhod
